section: codegen
synopsis: Fix a panic "Can't find weight for edge that should have one".
  Improve code layout through ensuring the CFG stays correct throughout the backend.
  Additionally we now use the improved CFG based code layout for the i386 backend.
mrs: !16535
issues: #27694 #27915
description: Fix the control flow graph tracking of the x86 native code generator
  for word-to-float conversions, 64-bit shifts on i386, other operations that
  introduce basic blocks, and for the stack allocation blocks inserted by the
  register allocator. This fixes a panic ("Can't find weight for edge that
  should have one") and improves code layout. The CFG is now also used
  for code layout and dead code elimination on i386.
